  <tag code="8.A" vocabulary="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">8.a - Increase Aid for Trade support for developing countries, in particular least developed countries, including through the Enhanced Integrated Framework for Trade-related Technical Assistance to Least Developed Countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">8.a - &#xd6;ka det handelsrelaterade st&#xf6;det (Aid for Trade) till utvecklingsl&#xe4;nderna, i synnerhet de minst utvecklade l&#xe4;nderna, bland annat genom det f&#xf6;rst&#xe4;rkta integrerade ramverket f&#xf6;r handelsrelaterat tekniskt bist&#xe5;nd till de minst utvecklade l&#xe4;nderna (Enhanced Integrated Framework for Trade-related technical Assistance to Least Developed Countries).</narrative>
  </tag>
